      "provenance": {
        "notes": "Clemson labels it not pet safe; agent, severity and symptoms are the agent's mapping. Missouri Botanical Garden's ZZ page failed (certificate error) and was not used. Interval: Missouri Botanical Garden 'regularly watered, but allow soils to dry between applications; avoid wet soils'; NC State 'watered routinely but allowed to dry out between waterings', rhizomes store water. No days given; fleshy rhizomes in a 13 cm pot make a fortnight a safe middle, so 14. Pot and season: 13 cm pot, bright indirect light, room temperature, growing season. Dry and wet tolerance days: no source gives days, left as before (from_knowledge_verify)."
      },
